#   mc "Why did she stop?"
    mc "Por que ela parou?"

# game/ep7.rpy:2013
translate brazil ep7_dbfea283:

#   mc "She got bored or something?"
    mc "Ela ficou entediada ou algo assim?"

# game/ep7.rpy:2014
translate brazil ep7_f64b40df:

#   mc "I don't think so..."
    mc "Eu não acho..."

# game/ep7.rpy:2017
translate brazil ep7_6f455c37:

#   j "I suggest you all give it a rest for now. Let it sink in and think about what you want to do next."
    j "Sugiro que todos deem um tempo nisso por enquanto. Deixem a situação se estabilizar e pensem no que querem fazer a seguir."

# game/ep7.rpy:2018
translate brazil ep7_e0137514:

#   j "Especially you, [mc]."
    j "Especialmente você, [mc]."

# game/ep7.rpy:2021
translate brazil ep7_61127d63:

#   k "Yes, I..."
    k "Sim, eu..."

# game/ep7.rpy:2022
translate brazil ep7_057c7307:

#   k "This is a bit too much for me... I don't even know what to say."
    k "Isso é demais para mim... Nem sei o que dizer."

# game/ep7.rpy:2023
translate brazil ep7_8ccd78b8:

#   k "I just can't believe that... Jovian..."
    k "Eu simplesmente não consigo acreditar que... Joviano..."

# game/ep7.rpy:2024
translate brazil ep7_f0ab474f:

#   mc "That's enough for now."
    mc "Por agora, basta."

# game/ep7.rpy:2025
translate brazil ep7_840763ca:

#   mc "It is what it is, this is where we are now."
    mc "É o que é, é aqui que estamos agora."

